Package: parrot-lab
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Parrot Lab contributors
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.43), libswiftlang (>= 6.1.3), libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.12), libgstreamer1.0-0, libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-0, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-libav
Recommends: ffmpeg
Description: Experimental SkyController telemetry and Bebop 2 video desktop
 Native Swift, GTK4 and GStreamer bench application for Ubuntu 26.04.
 Includes telemetry, H.264 preview, PNG capture and original-stream recording.
 This initial Linux port does not include flight controls or device installers.
